# What is tracked here is the *project*: the .wwu work units and the .wproj,
# which are text, diff usefully, and are the only part anybody authors.

# Third-party media. The convolution IR libraries and the SoundSeed Grain
# content are licensed downloads, 1.4 GB of them, reinstallable from source --
# unlike Originals/SFX, which is the piece's own recorded material and is
# tracked through git-lfs (see ../.gitattributes).
Originals/Plugins/
Originals/Voices/
# Scratch left behind by a plug-in's editor; referenced by nothing in the project.
Originals/SFX/untitled.wav

# Generated from the work units, and 80 MB a time.
GeneratedSoundBanks/
.cache/

# Per-machine, rewritten constantly, and named for the machine that wrote them.
*.validationcache
*.wsettings
